      "text": "And demand can cancel on you faster than supply can cancel on you: revenue falls immediately, costs fall slowly \u2014\nand the gap between those two speeds is exactly the size of the crisis.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "And demand can cancel on you faster than supply can cancel on you: revenue falls immediately, costs fall slowly \u2014\nand the gap between those two speeds is exactly the size of the crisis.",
